---
version: 2.0.2
title: CSV errors
file: ./test/margot_test.gleam
test_name: csv_error_test
---
- quote.i18n.csv: line 1: unescaped quote, double it (`""`) or quote the whole field
- closing.i18n.csv: line 1: the quote of this field is never closed
- fields.i18n.csv: the row `title` has 3 fields, expected a key and a value (quote the value if it contains a comma)
- single.i18n.csv: the row `title` has no value, expected a key and a value
- duplicate.i18n.csv: the key `a` is defined twice
- group.i18n.csv: the key `a.b` is inside `a` which is already a translation
- translation.i18n.csv: the key `a` is both a translation and a group
- empty.i18n.csv: the key `a..b` is empty or has an empty part
